        }
      ],
      "id": "q0le5jg"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "93iabe3",
      "content": "Certain chemicals are widely used in industries and daily life."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ht0v3zf",
      "content": "These chemicals are frequently asked in RRB examinations."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "cmixh2x",
      "content": "Understanding their formula and uses is very important."
    },
    {
      "id": "mmlltw0",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "2. Acids of Industrial Importance"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "i2wfxot",
      "content": "Sulphuric acid is called the 'King of Chemicals' due to its wide industrial use."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "saqr3vz",
      "content": "Nitric acid is mainly used in fertilizers and explosives."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "o76j7kf",
      "content": "Hydrochloric acid is used for cleaning metals."
    },
    {
      "id": "k199nzl",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "3. Alkalis and Common Bases"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "l4etuu5",
      "content": "Sodium hydroxide is used in soap and detergent manufacturing."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "jg7h0zk",
      "content": "Calcium hydroxide is used in whitewashing."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "82lqm28",
      "content": "Ammonium hydroxide is used as a cleaning agent."
    },
    {
      "id": "u90qqaw",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "4. Important Salts in Daily Life"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "n6bt7we",
      "content": "Sodium chloride is common salt used in food."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "2ukqf34",
      "content": "Baking soda is used in baking and fire extinguishers."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "f6juhbe",
      "content": "Washing soda is used for cleaning and removing hardness of water."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "yvylvcx",
      "content": "Plaster of Paris is used for making casts and moulds."
    },
    {
      "id": "xu5v0x4",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "5. Fertilizers"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "8o84tx1",
      "content": "Urea and ammonium nitrate are nitrogenous fertilizers."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "atumyfm",
      "content": "Superphosphate is a phosphatic fertilizer."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "4xy8zch",
      "content": "Potassium chloride is a potassic fertilizer."
    },
    {
      "id": "ic3dv25",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "6. Disinfectants and Bleaching Agents"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "if59yun",
      "content": "Bleaching powder is used for disinfecting water."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "hknkgsk",
      "content": "Chlorine is used for water purification."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "fujghit",
      "content": "Hydrogen peroxide is used as antiseptic."
    },
    {
      "id": "5t3l2q5",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "TABLE"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Industrial chemicals encompass essential acids, alkalis, common bases, and daily life salts.",
        "Agricultural and sanitation chemistry highlights fertilizers, disinfectants, and bleaching agents.",
        "High-frequency exam areas include laboratory chemicals, important gases, oxides, and medical drugs.",
        "Comprehensive one-liner revision spans atomic structure, chemical bonding, carbon, polymers, and environmental chemistry."
      ],
      "id": "s5rf0d1"
    },
